{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1637.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"c66ecd3c4d42c6fb8de3b57a0bff9dfc179c73bb102c32189e43cac92257a9a7","ja":"こんにちは～っ！\nねえねえ、キミたち、中学生？","zh":"你好～！\n呐呐，你们是初中生吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1637.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"defaee7b85c680f6a471538f0212036a2817fb866a96ebafb97a40f496bafa5c","ja":"あっ、急に声かけられて、緊張しちゃった？\nそんなときは～……「質問にはシーツもんでみる」？","zh":"啊，突然被搭话，感到紧张了吗？\n这种时候～……“遇到提问就揉揉床单”？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1637.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"fb9da3c1645e5c8e66de44df396f923d367b8492f648aea854889038955edb06","ja":"むむ、これは亜美もダジャレを言う流れと見た！\n「アイドルは、アイとドルでいっぱいだよ～☆」","zh":"唔唔，我看这势头亚美也得来一句谐音梗！\n“偶像（Idol）就是充满了爱（Ai）与美元（Dollar）呀～☆”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1637.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"f4ef934d2420a815d7c9d5cf95881d0fbf1a0a3950aa4e5a381948d0b9f9fd35","ja":"シーン……","zh":"静悄悄……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1637.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a8359af66d5db724076293d5d0bc1e94ca73232cde1769dd983630f8ae8e6b8f","ja":"ちょっとちょっとー！　そこは空気を読んで\n大笑いしてくれないと困るよ、キミたち～！","zh":"等等等等——！　那里你们得看气氛\n配合着大笑一场才行啊，各位～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1637.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"8dd025c4aa9c8dc6b7b73b4c818f3f6eb61bc3f692865d4aefdb0d0d5d356b3d","ja":"「……ふふっ」「あはは、キミたち面白～い！」\n「それ学校の制服～？　なんかキラキラしてる～！」","zh":"“……呵呵”“啊哈哈，你们真有意思～！”\n“那是学校的校服～？感觉闪闪发亮的～！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1637.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"452345b417ae1f7c237b407e0be66db3ce97a07723a7a8182e6b423eb78c6a2c","ja":"えへへ♪　かわいいでしょっ？\nこれは、杏奈たちが出てるドラマの衣装なんだ！","zh":"嘿嘿♪ 很可爱吧？\n这是杏奈她们出演的电视剧的服装哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1637.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"3fc0cf080b3be600608deff0da278359456f6afae7eadec1b51a205d73dae3c0","ja":"指示は、インタビュー場所を移動した後も続いて……","zh":"指示在更换采访地点后也一直持续着……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1637.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"6bad4d5a87c2a32ac21a81e0d4e300a87d1a23970d62956e65aacc57c74a7d0c","ja":"次は、「スクワット10回してから、\nダッシュ＆突撃インタビュー！」","zh":"接下来是，“做完10个深蹲之后，\n冲刺＆突击采访！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1637.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"0a52f78aaa0306ea733ab4fc1627b64e40c03dfacb6cc3fdc11ea0107b4638fc","ja":"1、2、3……10回！\nあっ、そこの人！　ちょっとお話し、いいかな～！","zh":"1、2、3……10次！\n啊，那边的！能跟你聊聊吗～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1637.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"2bbc66e247576a30d252021f8a36cc44df7962e8ebdb4608a3b441f6fc80727c","ja":"さすが、もっちーだね！　こんなにガンガン\n指示をこなしてくなんて、予想以上だよ！","zh":"不愧是饼饼！这么干脆利落地\n完成指令，超乎我的预料呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1637.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"62826e6691068a15a3c739f07efc16e104249619d5153be897f44e6baeda9600","ja":"ゲームのクエストだって思ったら、\nこれくらい余裕だよ♪","zh":"要是当作游戏里的任务，\n这点程度轻轻松松啦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1637.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"32f5f3904468c074829f341b4bf2dea83a6922fe11f527281836c3ae2f8b3cc6","ja":"おお～！　もっちーすっごいノリノリだね。\nそれじゃあ次は……えーっと……。","zh":"噢噢～！望智特别有干劲呢。\n那么接下来是……呃……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1637.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"8a0d9f2849dfbfd0643785279b1652364b14afcc21454ba81ce6791cf1a70e80","ja":"すぐには思いつかない？　それなら……\n今度は杏奈が、亜美ちゃんに指示を出す番だね♪","zh":"一时想不到吗？那样的话……\n下次就轮到杏奈给亚美下指令了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1637.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15","ja":"ええっ！？","zh":"诶诶！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
